OL,5,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,6,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the
OL,7,     FPhilharmonia Orchestra conducted
OL,8,     Fby Marin Alsop in a programme of
OL,9,     FAmerican classics including
OL,10,     FBernstein's West Side Story.
OL,11,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,12,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Feverything in between.
OL,17,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,18,     FAmerican jazz-funk legend James
OL,19,     FMason takes us round his record
OL,20,     Fcollection this week.
